OL,3,CFormer Syrian president Bashar al-
OL,4,CAssad sentenced to death in absentia
OL,6,FA Syrian court sentenced ousted Syrian
OL,7,Fpresident Bashar al-Assad and his
OL,8,Fyounger brother to death in absentia
OL,9,Ffor crimes against humanity and war
OL,10,Fcrimes.
OL,12,FThe Syrian civil war started in 2011
OL,13,Fas a result of crackdowns against pro-
OL,14,Fdemocracy Arab Spring protesters, but
OL,15,Fsoon evolved into something more
OL,16,Fcomplex, with various factions vying
OL,17,Ffor control.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
