PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786463298
OL,3,CFormer Syrian president Bashar al-
OL,4,CAssad sentenced to death in absentia
OL,6,FThe war lasted for around 14 years and
OL,7,Fhas cost around half a million lives.
OL,8,FAssad and his brother Maher fled to
OL,9,FRussia after insurgents marched into
OL,10,FDamascus in December 2014, but the
OL,11,Fconflict continued until late 2024.
OL,13,FAlso sentenced to death in the same
OL,14,Fcase on Tuesday was Assad's maternal
OL,15,Fcousin Atef Najib for leading the
OL,16,Fcrackdown in the southern province of
OL,17,FDaraa that led to the uprising and
OL,18,Flater the civil war.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
