PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786463298
OL,3,CFormer Syrian president Bashar al-
OL,4,CAssad sentenced to death in absentia
OL,6,FAmid tight security, Najib stood
OL,7,Finside a cage wearing a prisoner's
OL,8,Funiform as the judge read the sentence.
OL,10,FAfter Assad and his brother fled
OL,11,FSyria, Najib was later detained and
OL,12,Fbecame one of the highest-ranking
OL,13,Fofficials to be put on trial.
OL,15,FNajib is a former Syrian army
OL,16,Fbrigadier general who was head of the
OL,17,FPolitical Security Branch in southern
OL,18,FSyria's Daraa province under Assad in
OL,19,F2011.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
